{"tail":"Have mercy on the pillars (the pious) upon which Thou hast founded the footstool (the earth) and the throne; then the Galgal thunders and the throne resounds from Ophan to Ophan, from Hayah to Hayah, from Cherub to Cherub opposite the throne. "}
